  "title": "Independent Research Firm identifies Wipro as a Leader in Healthcare and Life Sciences Robotic Process Automation",
  "summary": "East Brunswick, New Jersey, USA and Bangalore, India – September 15, 2020: Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading global information technology, consulting and business process services company, today announced that it has been positioned as a Leader in The Forrester New Wave™: RPA Service Providers In Healthcare, Q3 2020.",
